:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Unicycle Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Tricycle Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked on day 3 of the [[Daily Bonus#Cat Stamp|Daily Cat Stamp]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] halves deploy cost. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he is unlocked from clearing [[Red Rectangle (Cats of the Cosmos)|Red Rectangle]] in chapter 3 and costs 20000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he is unlocked from tapping the Cat's [[Splash Text]] 100 times in the [[Cat Base Menu]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 17
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Tricycle Cat
|name2 = Biker Cat
|name3 = Unicycle Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Biker Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Unicycle Cat''' when obtained from [[Tricycle Awakens!]] (may drop on the first stage but guaranteed on the second) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This cat is useful to mass-produce once you have a lot of money, due to its short recharge time, high attack power, and area of effect. However, its very high cost and poor range drags it down, as even [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Flying Cat]] can do the job better with their higher overall stats. This unit's stats are not much use outside of [[Empire of Cats]].

Fortunately, this unit is included in several Cat Combos. Although many of these require Ubers and tend not to have any significant effect, they can be serviceable in the early game if said Ubers are owned, and some others only require accessible units. These combos may also work with any others you own and create exceptional synergies by enhancing your other units.

==='''True Form'''===
Unicycle Cat gains halved cost, allowing it to be spammed to greater effect, and an additional combo. Unfortunately, by the time this True Form is avaliable, you would have definitely unlocked superior spammable area attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]. While they may be more expensive, they do much more for the price they ask, and Unicycle Cat's lack of any outstanding attributes makes it ultimately irrelevant for proper use.

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave & Melee}}

